  aciklama:
  - "Adeta buz kesmi\u015F bir \"\xE7akmak ta\u015F\u0131\" var son k\u0131s\u0131mlarda.
    K\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir s\xFCrt\xFCnmeyle alev alabilecekken, so\u011Fuktan \xE7atlamak
    \xFCzere. Seni temsil etti\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm bu ta\u015Fa
    {{sayi,4,19}} g\xFCn sonra birilerinin elleri dokunacak. {{kelime, Yaz k\u0131\u015F
    demeden ince giyinen | Maddi imkanlar\u0131 \xE7ok yerinde olmas\u0131na ra\u011Fmen
    al\xE7akg\xF6n\xFCll\xFCl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC her daim koruyan | G\xFCzel olmas\u0131na
    ra\u011Fmen bir o kadar da m\xFCtevaz\u0131 | Zeki, yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131
    ve bir o kadar da m\xFCtevaz\u0131 | Babas\u0131n\u0131n ya da annesinin doktor
    oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Babas\u0131n\u0131n ya da annesinin
    \xF6\u011Fretmen oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Babas\u0131n\u0131n
    ya da annesinin avukat oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Babas\u0131n\u0131n
    ticaretle u\u011Fra\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve annesinin de ev han\u0131m\u0131
    oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Anne ve babas\u0131n\u0131n
    ayr\u0131 oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Anne ya da babas\u0131ndan
    birinin vefat etti\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Anne ya da babas\u0131n\u0131n
    eczac\u0131 oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Anne ya da babas\u0131n\u0131n
    bankac\u0131 oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm | Anne ya da babas\u0131n\u0131n
    sat\u0131\u015F veya pazarlama i\u015Fiyle u\u011Fra\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm}} ilk ki\u015Fi, \xE7ok \xF6nemli bir \u015Fey
    yaparak keyfini yerine getirecek. Ho\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ki\u015Fiyle
    bu durumun bir ilgisi var ama \xE7\xF6zemedim {{isim}}! Baz\u0131 hastal\u0131klar\u0131
    olan ya\u015Fl\u0131 bir akraban ise e\u011Fitimine dair dua ediyor. Bu dualar\u0131n
    y\xFCz\xFC suyu h\xFCrmetine, beklemedi\u011Fin bir ba\u015Far\u0131ya imza atacaks\u0131n."
